      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Eh? No, mira, estoy realizando labores\nde mantenimiento.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nAunque en este momento me estoy tomando\nun descanso.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 114
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0002>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Quieres usar este Holotransportador?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0051007500690065007200650073002000750073006100720020006500730074006500200048006F006C006F007400720061006E00730070006F0072007400610064006F0072003F00100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Lamentablemente, no va a poder ser!\nMe estoy encargando de repararlo.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nAunque en este momento lo único reparador es\nel descanso que me estoy tomando.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 157
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oye, tengo una idea, ¿por qué no tenemos\nun combate Pokémon?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00790065002C002000740065006E0067006F00200075006E006100200069006400650061002C002000BF0070006F007200200071007500E90020006E006F002000740065006E0065006D006F0073000A0075006E00200063006F006D006200610074006500200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E003F00100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Con un buen combate concluyo mi descanso\ny termino la tarea en un abrir y cerrar de ojos.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si quieres combatir, avísame.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300690020007100750069006500720065007300200063006F006D00620061007400690072002C00200061007600ED00730061006D0065002E00100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si me haces el favorcito de combatir, me pondré\nmanos a la obra para finiquitar la tarea.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Mi victoria será una obra maestra!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004D006900200076006900630074006F007200690061002000730065007200E100200075006E00610020006F0062007200610020006D00610065007300740072006100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Paso, gracias",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005000610073006F002C002000670072006100630069006100730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿No quieres? Bueno, entonces creo que\nme voy a tomar un descanso laaaaaaargo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Así me gusta! ¡Volveré al trabajo después\nde este Corte... Aéreo!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10041007300ED0020006D00650020006700750073007400610021002000A10056006F006C00760065007200E900200061006C002000740072006100620061006A006F00200064006500730070007500E90073000A006400650020006500730074006500200043006F007200740065002E002E002E0020004100E900720065006F002100100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Pfff, apuesto a que nadie más se anima a arreglar\nun Holotransportador en plena zona de combate!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Te luciste en este combate! Bueeeno,\nentonces es hora de retomar el trabajo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Voy a terminar la reparación en un parpadeo!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10056006F0079002000610020007400650072006D0069006E006100720020006C006100200072006500700061007200610063006900F3006E00200065006E00200075006E00200070006100720070006100640065006F002100100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Listo! ¡Ya se puede usar el Holotransportador\nde nuevo!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004C006900730074006F0021002000A1005900610020007300650020007000750065006400650020007500730061007200200065006C00200048006F006C006F007400720061006E00730070006F0072007400610064006F0072000A006400650020006E007500650076006F002100100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Por cierto, todos los Pokémon que usé para\ncombatir contra ti los capturé en los techos.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Fue mientras estaba trabajando.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nMe distraje tanto con eso que, cuando me\ndi cuenta, ya era hora del descanso...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n¡Pero no se lo digas a mi jefe, eh!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 158
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En fin, yo te recomiendo inspeccionar bien\nlos techos, porque ahí hay Pokémon de todo tipo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Viste como al final terminé la tarea en un abrir\ny cerrar de ojos? ¡A eso le llamo ser bueno!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En los techos encuentras Pokémon de todo tipo.\n¡Inténtalo!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 24,
